Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.EngineCoolant.Pressure:
  datatype: float
  type: sensor
  unit: kPa
  description: >
    Simulated engine-coolant pressure used for correlated cooling-system
    diagnostics. Custom project-specific VSS extension (no standard VSS
    path exists for coolant pressure as of VSS 4.0). Normal range:
    180-220 kPa. Fault threshold: <=150 kPa. Recovery threshold: >=180 kPa.